# Heavy / generated / unaudited media — keep out of git and the published site.
# Only reviewed, self-contained figures (media/reviewed/*.svg) and the small
# review/provenance markdown are tracked.
_edge_profile/
_review_thumbnails/
*.preview.png
openrouter_runs/
compiled/

# Heavy binaries (videos, audio, slide decks, large bitmaps). The reviewed
# SVGs inline their own compressed scene, so the source PNGs aren't needed.
*.mp4
*.m4a
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.png
